he Shadow Lurker who roams around the house trying to hunt you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be wary of the Gardener who roams outside in the garden trying to attack the cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be wary of the Pentagram who spawns randomly at the start of each night trying to attack the cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be wary of the other monster who will spawn on later nights</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you die to any monster there will be a hint available if you are struggling to fend the monster off.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collectables!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hidden trophies to unlock skins for the cat (changed in the settings).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hidden notes each night to uncover what happened (read in the main menu).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ending!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the ending by completing night 5 with a certain condition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the skills to survive each night and uncover the mystery that lies within?</p>","developers":["SupremeGuardianGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861450/40986826e3473d151af20cc3dcccde7af292f128/header.jpg?t=1758270860","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861450/1015087186/3727893db05ac772ece6d2471fb711bfbeda2ea1/1751699163/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752187913","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861450/1015087186/3727893db05ac772ece6d2471fb711bfbeda2ea1/1751699163/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752187913","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861450/1015087186/3